# Trivy suppressions. Format: one CVE per line, with the reason next to it.
#   CVE-XXXX-YYYYY  # why this finding is accepted
#
# Intentionally empty: the pipeline threshold is "CRITICAL/HIGH with a fix available"
# (--severity CRITICAL,HIGH --ignore-unfixed). There are none today, so nothing needs
# to be suppressed by hand. The remaining CRITICALs (all in perl-base, a base-OS
# package the app never runs) have no fix yet and the --ignore-unfixed flag already
# lets them through. See security/README.md.
